 2 and i think they should  come back so why not a disney channel  world banner montana high school musical  camp rock come on this is what dreams  are made of  okay i need it on record that was purely  a goof and i do not miss those musical  numbers at all swim this way  what was that about  but anyway let me know which worlds  you'd like to visit in kingdom hearts  for and crucially which ones you don't  want to see come up again  let me know in the comments below or  come find me on twitter i'm at lucy  james games for more on kingdom hearts  keep it gamespot  [Music]
 

